mass flowrate, Ib/s; V = average specific volume, ft3/lb;
and ts = propellant stay-time, s. A useful parameter relative to chamber volume
and residence time is the "characteristic length" (L*,
pronounced "L-star")—the chamber volume (in cubic
inches) divided by the nozzle sonic throat area (in
square inches):
